      "body": "Your projected retirement savings range from $931,045 in the cautious scenario to $1,720,487 in the strong scenario. These are planning estimates, not a guarantee. They assume real returns after fees of 1.95% to 5.95%, a 3.9% withdrawal rate, and that pre-tax accounts are reduced by 15%.",
