      "title": "Past Crisis Losses",
      "body": "In a replay of the 2008–09 financial crisis, your portfolio fell by $98,155, or 54.2%, from its high point. It took 25.5 months to recover in that replay. This looks back at history using today's portfolio weights; it does not predict what will happen next.",
